# Query: Sync Operations

Spec: QuerySyncOperations
Purpose:
  List and execute recommended sync operations for detected drift.

Query:
  show @sync
  where
    drift.status = DETECTED
    AND drift.classification != NO_CHANGE

  for each sync:
    target: <sdd | code | both>
    action: <update | fix | redesign>
    artifacts: [<file paths>]
    dependencies: [<task ids>]

  output:
    sync_plan:
      - sync_id: @sync.S<id>
        drift_id: @drift.D<id>
        operation: <SYNC_SDD | SYNC_CODE | SYNC_BOTH>
        target_files: [<paths>]
        rationale: <reason>
        requires_approval: <true | false>

SavedAs: @query:sync-operations

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  DriftSpec: @../lifecycle/drift.sdd
  DriftQuery: @drift-detection.sdd
  Decisions: @../decisions/INDEX.sdd
  Tasks: @../tasks/TASK-STATE-MACHINE.sdd

State: +
